--TEST--
a `return` with no value in a method that returns `int` is reported on the statement itself, so a whole-document answer names the `return`, `rule:ide/one-grammar-one-tree`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Counter {
    public function next(int $n): int {
        return;
    }
}
--REQUEST--
diagnostics
--EXPECT--
2:7-2:14 hint - a class `Counter` is not used anywhere in this workspace
3:21-3:25 hint - a method `Counter::next` is not used anywhere in this workspace
4:9-4:16 error E0822 `next` declares `int` but this `return` hands back nothing
